[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
claude-agent-acp speaks ACP on stdin/stdout; point your editor or agent
client at:

  %%PREFIX%%/bin/claude-agent-acp

It runs misc/claude-code's %%PREFIX%%/bin/claude by default; set
CLAUDE_CODE_EXECUTABLE to override that.

For the Tidewave app, which cannot download its own ACP executable on
FreeBSD, add to ~/.config/tidewave/app.toml and restart it:

  [env]
  TIDEWAVE_CLAUDE_AGENT_ACP_EXECUTABLE = "%%PREFIX%%/bin/claude-agent-acp"
EOM
}
]
